      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T13:01:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have an alternative proposal. Instead of two parameters which define linear intervals I suggest having an explicit list of days before:\n```\n  auth.tokenExpiryNoficationDaysBefore \u003d 30, 14, 7, 3, 2, 1\n```\n\nThis is predictable and human readable.",
