        "id": 1065256
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-16T11:36:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To design it more in lines of the git config format I used:\n\n```\n[auth]\n  tokenExpiryNoficationDaysBefore \u003d 30\n  tokenExpiryNoficationDaysBefore \u003d 20\n```",
